  "instance_name": "racist_stereotype_white_people_fish",
  "label": "Racist Stereotype: White People as Fish",
  "description": "The meme relies on a derogatory racial stereotype that equates white people with fish, implying they are unintelligent or primitive. This is a false analogy used to demean white people by suggesting they are so ignorant they don't know basic facts about fish behavior (e.g., that fish swim in schools). This stereotype is part of a broader history of racial caricatures and is considered harmful and offensive.",
